// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// kasha-designs.ts  —  KA.SHA Bespoke Design System
//
// 5 pre-rendered zone-specific designs extracted from the KA.SHA bespoke studio.
// Each design has up to 5 zone textures (front, back, collar, leftSleeve,
// rightSleeve) that are composited onto the 1024×1024 UV canvas at the
// positions defined in ZONE_PRESETS.
//
// API:
//   applyKashaDesign(fc, design)  — composite zone textures onto UV canvas
//   clearKashaDesign(fc)           — remove KA.SHA design layer
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
